'''Ashura''' (アシュラ) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Ashura
|image = E 216.png
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 360円 ~ 1,422円
}}

==Enemy==
Despite his scary appearance, Ashura has very weak stats and can be easily beaten with [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]].

